# Persisted UI state

Contract: [`docs/examples/ui/persisted-ui.md`](../../docs/examples/ui/persisted-ui.md).

Write on user gestures only; persist semantic values; no per-frame / settling write-back; restore clamps are read-side only; defaults on the owning settings type. Prefer partitioned settings structs (`crate-boundaries`).

New persisted fields: round-trip test (precedent `crates/sqyre-app/tests/macro_list_split.rs`); for gesture-gated writes also assert idle resize does not alter the store. Cookbook: `egui-interaction-testing` skill (Pattern 5).
